# Model binaries — best_model.pkl (1.4 MB) and feature_columns.pkl are
# tracked by git so Streamlit Community Cloud can load them at runtime.
# Large models (>50 MB) should use Git LFS instead.
# models/*.pkl   ← intentionally NOT ignored

